~ start
set State.in_dialogue = true

if State.rang == true:
	Phone: The unknown number is calling again...
else:
	Phone: An unknown number is calling...
- Answer
	Unknown Number: Listen carefully, You don't know me... but you will very soon.
	Unknown Number: There’s a green car waiting for you at the end of the road.
	Unknown Number: It'll bring you to me so you can get a blade from my house.
	Unknown Number: You are obligated to take care of someone who betrayed me.
	Unknown Number: Refuse, and I'll send someone to bring you both.
	set State.finished_dialogue = true
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	=> END
- Decline
	set State.rang = true
	=> start

set State.finished_dialogue = true
set State.in_dialogue = false
=> END
